WEBVTT

00:00:03.727 --> 00:00:10.132
Grandfather William claimed
Candy as his foster daughter.

00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:13.952
Grandfather William's decision is final.

00:00:14.524 --> 00:00:21.174
Aunt Elroy had no option but to acknowledge
Candy as a daughter of the Adley family.

00:00:22.984 --> 00:00:27.748
Happy like in a dream.

00:00:31.957 --> 00:00:33.884
Candy, this is your room!

00:00:34.362 --> 00:00:35.777
Here you go!

00:00:41.881 --> 00:00:43.685
This is my room?

00:00:45.132 --> 00:00:47.917
Candy, all of these things are yours.

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:49.727
Really?

00:00:50.706 --> 00:00:52.921
Am I really going to live in
here from today?

00:00:53.949 --> 00:00:56.513
Anthony, this bed is so soft!

00:00:57.068 --> 00:00:58.777
And the sofa is pretty!

00:00:58.812 --> 00:01:01.603
Candy, this cushion is soft as well!

00:01:03.651 --> 00:01:05.054
It's so cute!

00:01:05.288 --> 00:01:06.691
It's wonderful, Anthony.

00:01:06.726 --> 00:01:10.504
Candy, everybody is so glad
that you made it back.

00:01:10.539 --> 00:01:12.147
I'm glad, as well.

00:01:15.724 --> 00:01:19.344
Kurin, you're our friend now!
Come in!

00:01:25.326 --> 00:01:26.318
Kurin!

00:01:29.775 --> 00:01:34.305
This is great, Kurin!
I'm so happy!

00:01:37.293 --> 00:01:38.905
This smile suits you best.

00:01:42.224 --> 00:01:46.151
You'll be happy from now on, Candy.
Happiest in the world.

00:01:48.167 --> 00:01:50.352
Candy, you must be tired from
your long journey!

00:01:50.486 --> 00:01:53.356
-Get a good rest!
-That's right!

00:01:53.391 --> 00:01:54.647
We'll excuse ourselves!

00:01:54.772 --> 00:01:57.754
Thank you, Anthony, Stear, Archie.

00:01:57.789 --> 00:01:59.485
Sleep well, Candy!

00:02:03.542 --> 00:02:04.360
What?

00:02:07.103 --> 00:02:08.267
Okay, we're outta here!

00:02:09.979 --> 00:02:11.572
Sweet dreams, Candy!

00:02:11.607 --> 00:02:13.697
Hey, you were on your way out!

00:02:13.732 --> 00:02:15.333
Good night, Stear.

00:02:16.314 --> 00:02:18.462
Huh... what?

00:02:18.497 --> 00:02:19.887
Thank you so much, Stear!

00:02:20.121 --> 00:02:23.838
-Uh? Nah.. good night... good...
-Hey!

00:02:25.735 --> 00:02:29.423
I'm a daughter of the Adleys.
It's almost as if I were dreaming.

00:02:30.128 --> 00:02:34.382
I can't imagine how happy sister Pony
and sister Lane would be, if they knew.

00:02:36.294 --> 00:02:38.874
Yes, and mr. Albert, too!

00:02:39.291 --> 00:02:42.071
I wonder what happened to that
gentle man who liked animals.

00:02:42.695 --> 00:02:45.351
Maybe he is still living somewhere
with his animals?

00:02:46.510 --> 00:02:50.290
The day I got the pendant... from
the Prince on the hill.

00:02:50.992 --> 00:02:54.106
Sister Pony, sister Lane...
and mr. Albert.

00:02:54.363 --> 00:02:56.393
Archie, Stear, Anthony...

00:02:56.755 --> 00:02:59.601
...and grandfather William,
whom I haven't yet met.

00:02:59.956 --> 00:03:02.780
Thank you... thank you, everyone.

00:03:03.079 --> 00:03:07.399
Because of that one letter from grandfather
William, in which he claimed me as his daughter,

00:03:07.434 --> 00:03:10.106
...my destiny finally seems to be looking up.

00:03:10.656 --> 00:03:14.121
I never knew that one little bit of
paper could bring me this much happiness.

00:03:14.646 --> 00:03:18.247
If this is a dream,
I never want to wake up.

00:03:18.945 --> 00:03:20.040
Never.

00:03:30.431 --> 00:03:31.870
Birds are crying...

00:03:32.778 --> 00:03:33.711
This is...

00:03:34.049 --> 00:03:35.154
That's it!

00:03:37.098 --> 00:03:39.983
This is Adley's house!
It's not a dream!

00:03:40.566 --> 00:03:42.934
I'm a daughter of the Adleys...!

00:03:46.466 --> 00:03:47.746
Good morning, Kurin!

00:03:52.888 --> 00:03:54.477
A wonderful breeze!

00:03:59.287 --> 00:04:01.292
The roses are swaying
in the breeze.

00:04:02.055 --> 00:04:05.305
-Roses which Anthony grew...
-Good morning!

00:04:05.539 --> 00:04:06.881
You're...

00:04:09.155 --> 00:04:10.672
Dorothy, it's you!

00:04:11.473 --> 00:04:13.307
Candy, I'm so glad!

00:04:13.342 --> 00:04:14.832
Dorothy, how come you are you here?

00:04:15.402 --> 00:04:19.237
They have allowed me to take
care of you personally!

00:04:19.889 --> 00:04:23.472
Dorothy, you don't have to
speak so formally to me!

00:04:23.698 --> 00:04:25.083
I did my best!

00:04:25.507 --> 00:04:26.443
Oh my!

00:04:27.965 --> 00:04:29.581
But I'm glad for you!

00:04:29.779 --> 00:04:33.791
I was ordered by Aunt Elroy to take
care of the new mistress in the house

00:04:33.792 --> 00:04:35.151
until a replacement servant is found.

00:04:35.152 --> 00:04:37.172
-And it was you?
-That's right!

00:04:37.397 --> 00:04:40.308
Now that Candy is gone, we have
an excess of servants!

00:04:40.397 --> 00:04:41.895
I understand, madam!

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:45.392
And that's how it was!

00:04:45.546 --> 00:04:48.321
I'm so glad that you made it here!

00:04:48.322 --> 00:04:52.526
You're a princess from today!
Congratulations, Candy.

00:04:52.912 --> 00:04:54.670
Thank you, Dorothy.

00:04:54.887 --> 00:04:57.918
Well then, miss,
it's time to get dressed!

00:04:58.316 --> 00:05:01.141
Oh, I forgot about that!

00:05:02.323 --> 00:05:04.404
Choose just about any
dress you like!

00:05:04.439 --> 00:05:07.108
Wow, they are all incredible!
When did...

00:05:07.292 --> 00:05:11.414
I brought them here the night before.
It was Aunt Elroy's idea.

00:05:11.555 --> 00:05:13.209
Aunt Elroy?

00:05:14.425 --> 00:05:16.761
Dresses... for me?

00:05:18.765 --> 00:05:20.322
What do you think about this one?

00:05:20.486 --> 00:05:24.827
Maybe aunt Elroy is actually
a kind person, after all?

00:05:25.321 --> 00:05:27.470
I need to thank her for this.

00:05:27.505 --> 00:05:31.355
-Aunt! Why did you adopt Candy!?
-Why did you do that?

00:05:31.711 --> 00:05:33.945
It was grandfather William's decision.

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:36.641
But... you don't acknowledge it?

00:05:36.676 --> 00:05:38.978
That's right. I can't acknowledge it.

00:05:39.381 --> 00:05:42.035
Candy stole from us! She is a thief!

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:43.896
-I'm not!
-Candy...

00:05:44.101 --> 00:05:46.133
That's not true!
I would never do such a thing!

00:05:46.168 --> 00:05:49.678
Enough! What's up with this
tacky dress? It looks horrible!

00:05:50.644 --> 00:05:54.360
What are you saying! It was aunt
Elroy who gave me this dress!

00:05:55.293 --> 00:06:00.291
She had it perfectly tailored to my
sizes and then gave the dress to me!

00:06:00.556 --> 00:06:04.997
She only thinks that ladies of the Adley
family hate unusual things...

00:06:05.830 --> 00:06:08.974
Such things don't suit the
girl from Pony's home!

00:06:09.210 --> 00:06:11.386
And just what is Neil saying...?

00:06:11.574 --> 00:06:13.837
-Anyway, Candy is...
-Neil!

00:06:15.864 --> 00:06:16.902
Anthony!

00:06:17.084 --> 00:06:20.753
Candy isn't Leagan's servant anymore!
Neither she's a horse keeper!

00:06:21.763 --> 00:06:23.372
She's a daughter of the Adley family!

00:06:26.191 --> 00:06:28.365
Candice White... Adley!

00:06:28.564 --> 00:06:29.923
Speak properly to her!

00:06:32.329 --> 00:06:36.564
Aunt Elroy, will you really allow
this thief to become an Adley?

00:06:36.777 --> 00:06:39.068
You won't acknowledge her? Right?
Aunt?

00:06:39.847 --> 00:06:43.089
I can't go against William.

00:06:43.124 --> 00:06:45.563
But... I won't acknowledge her!

00:06:45.564 --> 00:06:46.003
Eliza!

00:06:46.004 --> 00:06:49.973
Stop! Haven't you promised that
you'd say it before aunt Elroy?

00:06:50.362 --> 00:06:52.810
Yes. Is Candy a thief, or not?

00:06:54.319 --> 00:06:58.661
Neil, remember what you promised just
before Candy went to Mexico?

00:06:58.944 --> 00:07:00.837
I hope you haven't forgotten already!

00:07:01.209 --> 00:07:02.269
Wait, Neil!

00:07:08.256 --> 00:07:11.378
Get it? Tell the truth now!

00:07:13.437 --> 00:07:16.516
So it was yours and Eliza's
ploy, after all!

00:07:18.342 --> 00:07:21.806
Then you'll tell the truth to
aunt Elroy first thing in the morning!

00:07:22.213 --> 00:07:25.045
Do you swear on the honour of the
Adley family?

00:07:27.673 --> 00:07:29.609
Now speak, like you promised!

00:07:31.146 --> 00:07:35.006
Before aunt Elroy...
...be a honourable Adley!

00:07:36.710 --> 00:07:39.452
Is Candice White Adley a thief?!

00:07:43.154 --> 00:07:45.731
Huh? Aunt Elroy, running away?

00:07:45.766 --> 00:07:50.309
I'm not running away! We have a party
tonight. I have to make preparations.

00:07:50.909 --> 00:07:54.050
Oh, a party! That's right,
it's in Candy's honour!

00:07:54.947 --> 00:07:56.761
Can't wait!

00:07:57.316 --> 00:08:00.191
Don't tell me... a party for me?

00:08:00.226 --> 00:08:01.089
Aunt!

00:08:01.852 --> 00:08:02.839
Hold right there!

00:08:04.054 --> 00:08:06.217
Neil, this isn't over yet.

00:08:08.859 --> 00:08:11.039
Neil, is Candy a thief?

00:08:11.454 --> 00:08:12.249
Well?!

00:08:12.883 --> 00:08:13.921
She... she's not.

00:08:14.197 --> 00:08:15.209
Say it out louder!

00:08:15.832 --> 00:08:18.220
Candy is not a thief.

00:08:18.368 --> 00:08:21.748
You and Eliza made it up in order
to drive Candy out of the house!

00:08:21.938 --> 00:08:23.190
Is that right?

00:08:26.625 --> 00:08:27.920
Apologize to Candy!

00:08:30.468 --> 00:08:35.149
Neil, we know what happened on the day
when Candy arrived to Leagan family.

00:08:35.150 --> 00:08:36.762
Now we expect you to do the same thing!

00:08:36.962 --> 00:08:39.897
You made Candy apologize
to prevent Dorothy from getting fired!

00:08:41.485 --> 00:08:45.040
He and Eliza even told Candy
how to apologize!

00:08:45.127 --> 00:08:48.205
Candy, apologize to Neil and Eliza!

00:08:48.240 --> 00:08:51.318
Candy, you're supposed to
apologize on your knees.

00:09:02.085 --> 00:09:07.693
You haven't apologized unless you say
"Forgive me, I was wrong."

00:09:08.121 --> 00:09:11.456
Forgive me, I was wrong.

00:09:11.663 --> 00:09:13.334
Say it louder!

00:09:14.537 --> 00:09:17.266
Forgive me, I was wrong!

00:09:17.399 --> 00:09:18.856
Louder!

00:09:20.053 --> 00:09:22.478
Forgive me, I was wrong!

00:09:23.925 --> 00:09:27.448
-You know how to do it, then.
-Get on your knees!

00:09:27.483 --> 00:09:30.260
And say, "Forgive me, I was wrong."

00:09:30.682 --> 00:09:31.859
Now, hurry up!

00:09:37.367 --> 00:09:38.365
Wait!

00:09:40.392 --> 00:09:41.553
Candy!

00:09:42.516 --> 00:09:45.206
It's okay.
That's enough!

00:09:45.754 --> 00:09:46.633
Hey!

00:09:48.021 --> 00:09:51.419
-Candy, why did you stop him?
-They treated you so badly.

00:09:51.454 --> 00:09:52.470
But I'm okay with that.

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:54.599
I'll remember this!

00:09:56.260 --> 00:09:58.945
I don't bear a grudge against
Neil and Eliza!

00:09:58.980 --> 00:09:59.751
Why?

00:09:59.786 --> 00:10:04.770
If the two of them hadn't framed me for
theft, I wouldn't have been sent to Mexico.

00:10:04.942 --> 00:10:07.144
And I wouldn't have become an Adley.

00:10:07.179 --> 00:10:08.960
Candy, you...

00:10:09.162 --> 00:10:12.104
Sister Pony and Sister Lane
have told me this.

00:10:12.607 --> 00:10:14.892
These are the words from the Lord.

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:22.476
If one can forgive other people's mistakes,
his heavenly Father will forgive him as well.

00:10:23.609 --> 00:10:31.962
If one doesn't wish to forgive,
his Father won't forgive him as well.

00:10:39.348 --> 00:10:40.979
What a wonderful smell.

00:10:43.358 --> 00:10:43.999
Anthony!

00:10:44.379 --> 00:10:46.774
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
Huh? Where did this come from?

00:10:47.129 --> 00:10:50.512
Candy, you really are a kind girl.

00:10:51.303 --> 00:10:53.021
You know, Anthony...

00:10:53.056 --> 00:10:53.814
What is it?

00:10:54.019 --> 00:10:55.037
I'm sorry.

00:10:55.426 --> 00:10:56.114
For what?

00:10:56.320 --> 00:11:00.894
I sold the Sweet Candy you gave me
in order to help somebody.

00:11:01.210 --> 00:11:04.050
It's okay, Candy.
Look around!

00:11:04.370 --> 00:11:07.765
There are so many Sweet Candies now!
And they are all yours!

00:11:09.398 --> 00:11:10.184
Anthony!

00:11:12.619 --> 00:11:13.322
Oops.

00:11:15.064 --> 00:11:16.155
That's...

00:11:16.674 --> 00:11:17.494
This?

00:11:17.657 --> 00:11:19.034
That pendant...

00:11:23.683 --> 00:11:27.642
-My Prince lost it.
-Your Prince?

00:11:27.677 --> 00:11:28.895
I don't know his name.

00:11:29.297 --> 00:11:31.246
I just call him like that.

00:11:43.156 --> 00:11:46.548
You know, you startled me
when I first saw you.

00:11:46.583 --> 00:11:49.082
I thought you looked exactly like
the Prince!

00:11:49.394 --> 00:11:53.014
Just like the time on the Pony's hill...
wearing a kilt, and carrying bagpipes.

00:11:53.198 --> 00:11:57.287
Candy, men of the Adley family
usually have that pendant.

00:11:57.692 --> 00:12:01.624
Really?
Then... the Prince was an Adley?

00:12:02.859 --> 00:12:04.405
Maybe... I think so.

00:12:05.641 --> 00:12:10.049
Who was it? Who is the one
who met Candy during her childhood?

00:12:11.467 --> 00:12:12.398
Just who was it?

00:12:12.804 --> 00:12:16.414
Was it an Adley who captured her heart?

00:12:16.830 --> 00:12:18.430
What's the matter, Anthony?

00:12:21.495 --> 00:12:25.941
Candy... you still haven't
forgotten about your prince?

00:12:28.969 --> 00:12:33.000
Was it... because I look a bit like him?

00:12:34.057 --> 00:12:36.403
Anthony!
That's not true!

00:12:36.438 --> 00:12:40.297
I don't care who the Prince is!
Anthony, it's because...

00:12:42.895 --> 00:12:45.650
...because...
I like you.

00:13:09.264 --> 00:13:10.031
Candy!

00:13:19.019 --> 00:13:20.298
I said it.

00:13:20.689 --> 00:13:22.169
My heart is pounding.

00:13:22.688 --> 00:13:24.290
Anthony is wonderful!

00:13:26.216 --> 00:13:27.710
I like Anthony!

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:30.190
I like him more than anyone else!

00:13:39.217 --> 00:13:40.941
Anthony!

00:13:44.834 --> 00:13:46.910
Anthony!

00:13:58.580 --> 00:14:00.957
-Candy!
-Yes?

00:14:01.348 --> 00:14:02.882
Where did you go?

00:14:04.345 --> 00:14:06.736
Yes... I was going for a walk.

00:14:06.989 --> 00:14:11.444
You're not a servant anymore.
You're a daughter of an Adley!

00:14:11.858 --> 00:14:12.598
Yes.

00:14:13.348 --> 00:14:15.820
You can't just leave the estate
whenever you feel like to.

00:14:16.191 --> 00:14:16.942
Yes.

00:14:16.977 --> 00:14:20.162
Tonight we are doing a dinner party
in your honor.

00:14:20.377 --> 00:14:21.550
Dinner party?

00:14:22.097 --> 00:14:27.035
Got it? Behave yourself and don't do
anything to embarrass the family.

00:14:27.754 --> 00:14:29.720
Yes, I understand!

00:14:32.033 --> 00:14:35.262
They are doing a party for me.
For me!

00:14:35.334 --> 00:14:37.309
This is the first time in my life!

00:14:37.548 --> 00:14:38.688
Excuse me!

00:14:38.912 --> 00:14:40.500
It's you, Dorothy!

00:14:40.712 --> 00:14:42.404
You are invited to join everyone!

00:14:42.535 --> 00:14:45.590
Dorothy, please don't be so formal!

00:14:45.803 --> 00:14:48.431
But... you are my master now!

00:14:49.135 --> 00:14:52.700
Dorothy... you and I will be
friends forever!

00:14:52.735 --> 00:14:53.624
But...

00:14:53.815 --> 00:14:57.493
Alright then, we'll talk like friends
whenever nobody can see us!

00:14:57.902 --> 00:15:01.265
Well then, Candy!
The dinner will be served now!

00:15:01.300 --> 00:15:03.100
Alright then!

00:15:04.120 --> 00:15:08.238
Dinner... I think I can go in this dress.

00:15:08.404 --> 00:15:12.195
No, no!
For a dinner, you need an evening gown.

00:15:12.384 --> 00:15:14.031
You'll make me angry!

00:15:14.400 --> 00:15:16.502
Now, we have to get you
looking good first!

00:15:16.537 --> 00:15:18.885
There are so many annoying
regulations, right?

00:15:18.920 --> 00:15:21.170
You'll learn to cope with them!

00:15:21.205 --> 00:15:23.711
Maybe so.
Dorothy, are you happy?

00:15:23.908 --> 00:15:27.481
I'm as happy as I can be.
Candy, you?

00:15:27.866 --> 00:15:29.746
I'm the happiest one in the world!

00:15:29.858 --> 00:15:30.999
I'm glad.

00:15:31.949 --> 00:15:34.564
Don't do anything stupid now!

00:15:36.252 --> 00:15:40.950
-Candy, it's dinner time!
-The three of us are here to escort you!

00:15:41.169 --> 00:15:43.266
May we enter, miss Candy?

00:15:43.499 --> 00:15:44.377
Please do!

00:15:44.412 --> 00:15:45.899
I'm entering then!

00:15:46.817 --> 00:15:47.967
Wonderful!

00:15:48.002 --> 00:15:50.571
Me wanna see!
Woohoo, pretty!

00:16:05.879 --> 00:16:09.597
A green evening gown...

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:15.146
Mama.

00:16:21.984 --> 00:16:24.422
This Anthony dude is totally speechless.

00:16:27.650 --> 00:16:30.031
Thank you for inviting us tonight!

00:16:30.393 --> 00:16:32.493
Welcome. Here, come in.

00:16:33.650 --> 00:16:38.156
Okay, Eliza? Don't give up to anyone.
Behave yourself and be elegant.

00:16:38.157 --> 00:16:39.350
I understand, mother.

00:16:40.094 --> 00:16:43.750
He's totally obsessed over Candy.
I'll let him see all of her faults.

00:16:43.837 --> 00:16:46.057
I'll make you look like a
redneck before everybody.

00:16:46.416 --> 00:16:47.890
Thank you for waiting!

00:16:54.033 --> 00:16:57.266
Everyone, meet Candice White Adley.

00:16:57.807 --> 00:17:01.152
Her dress is better than mine...
and that ribbon... it's silk!

00:17:06.465 --> 00:17:11.101
I think it's time to begin. Grandfather
William, in yet another one of his whims,

00:17:11.136 --> 00:17:14.504
decided to adopt Candy into the Adley
family as his daughter.

00:17:14.539 --> 00:17:18.351
She will be introduced to the rest of the
family later on, but today I want her...

00:17:18.386 --> 00:17:22.873
...to introduce herself specially for the
Leagan family. Now, Candy, it's your turn.

00:17:23.187 --> 00:17:24.728
Nice to meet you!

00:17:34.109 --> 00:17:37.735
-Now, Candice, your seat is over there.
-Yes.

00:17:39.426 --> 00:17:42.465
You're better than me?
I'll show you.

00:17:51.050 --> 00:17:54.714
She sat closer to the head of the table...
I'm going back!

00:17:56.335 --> 00:17:59.913
Eliza!
Wait, Eliza!

00:17:59.948 --> 00:18:05.038
Mother, Candy is sitting closer to the head
of the table than I am! I don't want that!

00:18:05.073 --> 00:18:10.737
Eliza, I understand your feelings, but
Adleys are ranked much higher than Leagans.

00:18:10.772 --> 00:18:15.560
Please bear this. Candy is still no
match for you. Right?

00:18:16.222 --> 00:18:17.481
I understand.

00:18:21.413 --> 00:18:22.337
Candy.

00:18:23.350 --> 00:18:26.361
Elegant people drink their
soup without slurping.

00:18:29.111 --> 00:18:30.766
Thank you, I won't do that!

00:18:33.208 --> 00:18:36.624
They didn't really teach you any
table manners in Pony's home?

00:18:37.437 --> 00:18:38.352
Yeah...

00:18:38.620 --> 00:18:40.040
Damn it...

00:18:40.956 --> 00:18:43.557
Eliza, please teach me from now on!

00:18:43.928 --> 00:18:48.129
I want to become an elegant, gentle
lady, just like you!

00:18:57.757 --> 00:18:59.180
Sorry, aunt.

00:18:59.972 --> 00:19:03.630
That'll be good. I know she
won't give up to Eliza!

00:19:05.431 --> 00:19:09.389
That's right. I'm sure that
Candy will become a wonderful lady.

00:19:09.566 --> 00:19:15.130
After everyone in the Adley family
takes a liking to her, I will...

00:19:23.301 --> 00:19:25.048
It's nothing!

00:19:25.455 --> 00:19:27.509
Huh? I haven't said anything.

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:33.173
Yes!

00:19:33.355 --> 00:19:34.363
Dorothy!

00:19:34.575 --> 00:19:36.358
Candy! What happened?

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:38.392
I snuck away from the party.

00:19:39.549 --> 00:19:41.999
Candy, you mustn't come to this place!

00:19:42.848 --> 00:19:45.269
Dorothy, I just got a good idea.

00:19:45.831 --> 00:19:47.867
We can stay together forever!

00:19:49.365 --> 00:19:52.178
I will ask aunt Elroy...

00:19:52.179 --> 00:19:53.188
Candy!

00:19:53.363 --> 00:19:58.300
If I do that, you could become even
happier! Okay? Come with me, Dorothy!

00:19:58.390 --> 00:20:00.211
Hold on, Candy!

00:20:08.592 --> 00:20:12.054
It's true that I've become much
happier now that I'm your servant.

00:20:12.442 --> 00:20:13.182
But...

00:20:13.244 --> 00:20:14.237
But?

00:20:15.421 --> 00:20:18.022
Can you really call it happiness?

00:20:18.187 --> 00:20:19.144
Dorothy?

00:20:20.181 --> 00:20:24.723
Candy, happiness isn't just something
that can be passed from one to another.

00:20:25.295 --> 00:20:27.558
Happiness is something you build
for yourself.

00:20:27.593 --> 00:20:30.727
Just like you can only be saved by God.

00:20:37.584 --> 00:20:39.756
Actually, it's just like Dorothy said.

00:20:40.288 --> 00:20:43.645
I thought that I'd be happy if
I got adopted by the Adley family.

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:46.036
But that was just my wishful thinking.

00:20:46.940 --> 00:20:50.283
Yes. I need to catch my own happiness.

00:20:51.009 --> 00:20:52.587
I've made up my mind.

00:20:53.364 --> 00:20:55.740
Dorothy, thank you.

00:20:57.002 --> 00:21:02.120
In that moment, Candy swore that
she will pursue her own happiness.

00:21:03.955 --> 00:21:06.936
And it was such a beautiful,
moonlit evening.

00:21:16.361 --> 00:21:20.702
To be continued.
